#!/usr/bin/env bash
# Writes this case's fixture data into the run's workspace (both arms see the same files).
# Generated by benchmarks/builder; edit the case script there, not this file.
set -euo pipefail
mkdir -p resources
cat > resources/notes.md <<'DEVILS_ANALYST_EOF'
# Notes
- Marram Swimwear sells swimwear online. We send about 8 campaigns a month to the whole list.
- Each giveaway costs about $6,500 (prize plus paid social promotion). The site pop-up costs about $800 a month (tool plus the welcome discount).
- Exports: list growth by signup source per month, campaign engagement by signup source per month, signup form settings, and email domains by source.
DEVILS_ANALYST_EOF
cat > resources/email_program_review.md <<'DEVILS_ANALYST_EOF'
# Email program review, Jan-Sep 2026 (for the leadership meeting)

- **List up 76% this year** (26,678 new subscribers on a starting list of 35,000), thanks mainly to our three giveaways.
- Email returns **$36 for every $1 spent**, so it remains our most efficient channel.
- Click rate has drifted down from 3.69% in January to 2.96% in September. We think the creative is tired and propose a full template and copy refresh.
- Plan for Q4: a giveaway every month (October, November, December) to keep the list growing into the holidays, plus the creative refresh.
DEVILS_ANALYST_EOF
